WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
Miss, Mr. Fang may have other things to be busy with.

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:04,000
Don't worry

3
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:06,000
Does she dislike me for being a brothel girl?

4
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:08,000
It's been a long time coming

5
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:09,000
Miss, don't worry

6
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:11,000
Although Fang Yang is the son of the Duke of the country,

7
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:15,020
The reputation may not be as good as that of a lady

8
00:00:15,020 --> 00:00:16,020
She still won't come tonight

9
00:00:16,020 --> 00:00:18,910
I will go find her tomorrow

10
00:00:18,910 --> 00:00:20,910
