16
00:00:31,830 --> 00:00:34,280
As long as she wants

17
00:00:34,280 --> 00:00:35,280
I am just a slave

18
00:00:35,280 --> 00:00:39,460
I am also willing, young master

19
00:00:39,460 --> 00:00:41,460
Now we make money

20
00:00:41,460 --> 00:00:42,460
Do you want to mortgage the land?

21
00:00:42,460 --> 00:00:44,460
redemption comes redemption

22
00:00:44,460 --> 00:00:45,460
Definitely have to redeem

23
00:00:45,460 --> 00:00:48,460
You made the right decision to let Uncle Fang handle it.

24
00:00:48,460 --> 00:00:49,460
Take my prodigal father by the way

25
00:00:49,460 --> 00:00:50,460
something mortgaged

26
00:00:50,460 --> 00:00:52,460
They all came here to redeem themselves
